From 586a8acaf7e5f7a45cfabd03c273b5bd8a0d7b3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 05:52:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Epic Games friends page and party status card

Friends (Account Management > Epic Games Friends):
- Friends, received, sent and blocked lists of the selected account, from
  the friends summary, with names resolved in batches of 100.
- Add by display name or account ID; accept, reject, cancel, remove, block
  and unblock per row; bulk remove, accept, reject and cancel run one
  request per second with progress and a stop button.
- Destructive and bulk actions ask for confirmation.
- Local search and a virtualized list for accounts with thousands of
  entries.

Party:
- New card on the party page with the selected account's party: members,
  leader, size and privacy, retrying every 10 s while there is no party.
- Leader actions: promote, kick (still behind the partyKick flag), toggle
  privacy and fix invite. The existing cards are unchanged.

The new IPC channels use invoke/handle. Pure helpers are tested in
src/lib/parsers/friends.test.ts and party-info.test.ts.
